
:: MP NPC Sera Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 0 }>><</if>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>><<set _open to (Time.hour gte 8 and Time.hour lt 21)>><<if _open>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>><</if>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "High Street">><</if>>
<<if _open>>
<<endevent>><<generateNPC 1 "a" "f" "f">><<person1>>
<<if $mpNpcs.sera.firstMeet>>柜台后的人摘下单眼放大镜，在围裙上擦了擦手：「修表，还是带了旧物？……叫我塞拉就行。」<<set $mpNpcs.sera.firstMeet to 0>><<elseif (_npc.love or 0) gte 18>>煤油灯暖光映着<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>的侧脸。听见门铃响，她放下镊子翻过木牌，握住你微凉的指尖贴在颊边：「我听着钟声，就知你该来了。」<<elseif (_npc.love or 0) gte 6 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 6>>推开高街钟表铺的玻璃门，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>摘下放大镜，将柜上一杯热红茶推到你手边：「外面风大，先暖暖手。」<<else>>钟表铺里浮着机油与旧纸气息。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>戴着单眼放大镜夹着细齿轮，抬眼看向你：「要修表，还是带了旧物？」<</if>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>窗外雨水顺着玻璃滑落，店内座钟齐声滴答。<<else>>斜阳穿过橱窗，在黄铜钟摆上投下金光。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">离开 (0:02)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[聊钟表旧闻 (0:06)|MP NPC Sera Chat]]>><<pass 6>><<stress -4>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[给她看古物 (0:08)|MP NPC Sera Service]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[分拣机芯齿轮 (0:16)|MP NPC Sera Help]]>><<pass 16>><<tiredness 2>><<stress -3>><</link>>
<br>
<<if (_npc.stage or 0) lt 10 and (!$daily or !$daily.mpNpcQuest_sera)>>
	<<link [[问起停摆怀表 (0:20)|MP NPC Sera Quest]]>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpNpcQuest_sera to 1>><<pass 20>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<else>>
<span class="disabled">钟表铺已经落锁，玻璃窗里只亮着一盏值夜的煤油灯。柜台后没有回应，看来得等营业时间（8:00–21:00）再来。</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Sera Chat [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcChat_sera>><<set $daily.mpNpcChat_sera to 1>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.sera.firstMeet>>柜台后的人摘下单眼放大镜，在围裙上擦了擦手：「修表，还是带了旧物？……叫我塞拉就行。」<<set $mpNpcs.sera.firstMeet to 0>><<elseif (_npc.love or 0) gte 18>>你坐在柜台内侧的高脚凳上，看<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>用绒布擦拭古董三问表。她偏头与你低语，顺手将碎发别到你耳后。<<elseif (_npc.love or 0) gte 6>>你倚在柜台边与<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>聊起高街近况。她转动游丝扳手，提醒你夜里避开市政厅后巷的巡哨。<<else>>你隔着玻璃展柜看<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>校准钟摆。她话虽不多，但每当你问起机芯来历，她都会耐心解答。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[回塞拉身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回塞拉身边 (0:02)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<loveicon>><<link [[灯下握她手腕 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera Flirt]]>><<pass 4>><<arousal 300>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ((_npc.love or 0) gte 15 or (_npc.lust or 0) gte 12) and (!$daily or !$daily.mpNpcIntimate_sera)>>
	<<mphearticon>><<link [[随她上阁楼 (0:25)|MP NPC Sera Intimate]]>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpNpcIntimate_sera to 1>><<pass 25>><<arousal 1200>><<stress -10>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if (_npc.love or 0) gte 8 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 8>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[约她逛街 (0:08)|MP Extra Daily Sera 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<if (_npc.love or 0) gte 12 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 12>><br><<link [[雨夜留下来陪她 (0:08)|MP RelDay Sera 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP NPC Sera Service [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>>
<<if ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) gt 0>>
	<<set _cnt to $mpAntiquesUnappraised>><<set _pay to _cnt * 1500>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to 0>><<money _pay>>
	<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>你取出收集到的未鉴定古物放在绒布垫上。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>戴上放大镜细看铭文，从抽屉里点出银币递给你。<span class="gold">你换到了应得的古物折现。</span>
<<else>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>用绒布擦了擦放大镜：「去海滩暗礁或旧街巷尾找找，若有蒙尘的古物，随时拿来给我掌眼。」<span class="teal">她顺手替你紧了紧衣袖铜扣。</span><<stress -2>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[回塞拉身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回塞拉身边 (0:02)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<div id="srv-sub-sera">
<<investigateicon>><<link "请她调校表扣 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#srv-sub-sera">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>你屏息扶稳灯座，看她两指轻拨簧片。<span class="green">卡扣应声归位，你学到了一手巧劲。</span><<stress -2>><<else>>你呼吸急了些，灯影晃动。<span class="red">铜镊擦过表壳，只得下次再试。</span><<stress 2>><</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_clockwork_core"]>><br><<keepsakeicon>><<link [[请她看游丝芯 (0:06)|MP Keepsake Show Core]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP NPC Sera Help [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _helpPaid to 0>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcHelp_sera>>
	<<set $daily.mpNpcHelp_sera to 1>><<set _helpPaid to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>><<money 1200>><</if>>
<</if>>
<<if _helpPaid>>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>你按齿数分拣黄铜齿轮，还找出一枚卡在暗槽的银壳怀表。<span class="green"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把 <span class="gold">£12</span> 修表分红塞进你手心。</span><<stress -3>><<else>>微小齿轮看得你眼酸，漏排了两组垫片。<span class="teal"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>替你收尾，只替你收拾好工具，没有补贴。</span><<stress 2>><</if>>
<<else>>你又陪<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>理了一匣零散垫片。<span class="teal">木匣整整齐齐，她给你添了半杯热红茶。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[回塞拉身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回塞拉身边 (0:02)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[校齐游丝 (0:06)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 6>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<else>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Flirt [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcFlirt_sera>><<set $daily.mpNpcFlirt_sera to 1>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.lust to Math.min(100, (_npc.lust or 0) + 2)>><</if>>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 240 or (_npc.love or 0) gte 10>>你凑近煤油灯握住<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>微凉的手腕。她指尖一颤，反手与你十指相扣，耳根染上薄红：「别闹，游丝要偏了。」<span class="green">她眼底满是纵容。</span><<stress -3>><<else>>你借着递镊子轻轻擦过<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>的手背。她抬眸看了你一眼，嘴角微扬。<span class="teal">气氛柔和了几分。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[回塞拉身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回塞拉身边 (0:02)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<socialiseicon>><<link [[低声交谈 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera Chat]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">低声交谈 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>

:: MP NPC Sera Intimate [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>>
<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 3)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.lust to Math.max(0, (_npc.lust or 0) - 3)>>
阁楼天窗外夜色深沉。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>摘下眼镜，任由你将她揽在绒毯边。她温热的呼吸拂过你颈侧，在滴答钟声里紧握着你的手。<span class="green">疲惫与寒意一扫而空。</span><<stress -12>><<tiredness -4>><<trauma -4>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[整理衣衫 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">整理衣衫 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>

:: MP NPC Sera Quest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 0 }>><</if>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>><<set _stg to (_npc.stage or 0)>>
<<if _stg gte 5>>
	<<include "MP NPC Sera Quest Late">>
<<elseif _stg is 2>>
	竖井铁栅上的铜挂锁已被水汽锈死。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>半蹲在石阶上递来煤油棉签，让你趁巡夜换班空档挑锁，或去扳开侧壁的通风活页。
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[回塞拉身边 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回塞拉身边 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 240 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 8>>
		<<investigateicon>><<link [[挑开锈锁舌 (0:08)|MP NPC Sera Quest 3 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<walkicon>><<link [[挑开锈锁舌 (0:08)|MP NPC Sera Quest 3 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11500 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 10>>
		<<fisticon>><<link [[扳开侧壁活页栓 (0:08)|MP NPC Sera Quest 3 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[扳开侧壁活页栓 (0:08)|MP NPC Sera Quest 3 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.stage to Math.min(10, _stg + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>>
	<<if _stg is 0>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>取出停在十一时四十七分的银壳怀表，挑开内盖露出十二宫齿痕：「这是旧钟塔早年的副轴制式。」
	<<elseif _stg is 1>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>拼起三份市政修缮底图，量出钟塔基座下被封死的通风竖井：「明晚换班时，我们去听听擒纵叉动静。」
	<<elseif _stg is 3>>回到二楼工作台，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>熔化焊锡，让你用夹具稳住受损冠轮。火苗映着她的瞳孔，齿轮终于修整如初。
	<<elseif _stg is 4>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>将复原的冠轮卡进副轴槽位，报时音筒转过半圈，吐出一卷藏在空心轴里的羊皮星盘底图。
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_sera_" + _npc.stage)>>
		<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 250>><<money 1500>><<stress -4>><span class="gold"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>将 <span class="gold">£15</span> 补贴塞进你掌心。</span><<else>><<stress 2>><span class="gold"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>没有补贴。</span><</if>>
	<<else>><<stress -2>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[收好东西回去 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">收好东西回去 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if _npc.stage gte 5>><<link [[翻看后续卷宗 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Quest Late]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[与塞拉核对去向 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">与塞拉核对去向 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Sera Quest Late [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>><<set _stg to (_npc.stage or 5)>>
<<if _stg is 5>>
	羊皮星盘底图在胡桃木桌上摊开，标着天文翼楼与机括城的三条轴线。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>递来分规，让你测算空缺月相轮齿距，或去翻查早年修表底簿。
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[回塞拉身边 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回塞拉身边 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($maths or 0) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 250>>
		<<investigateicon>><<link [[测算朔望齿距 (0:08)|MP NPC Sera Quest 6 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<walkicon>><<link [[测算朔望齿距 (0:08)|MP NPC Sera Quest 6 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($history or 0) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 250 or (_npc.love or 0) gte 10>>
		<<keepsakeicon>><<link [[翻查修表底簿 (0:08)|MP NPC Sera Quest 6 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[翻查修表底簿 (0:08)|MP NPC Sera Quest 6 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif _stg is 8>>
	高街钟塔顶层的配重副轴正在高速空转，必须在午夜前将鎏金核心嵌入主擒纵轮。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>握紧制动杆，喊你看准缺口推入核心，或拽住副轴配重铁索减速。
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[先退回塞拉身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">先退回塞拉身旁 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 270 or ($science or 0) gte 260>>
		<<link [[推入鎏金核心 (0:10)|MP NPC Sera Quest 9 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[推入鎏金核心 (0:10)|MP NPC Sera Quest 9 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11800 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 12>>
		<<link [[拽住配重铁索 (0:10)|MP NPC Sera Quest 9 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[拽住配重铁索 (0:10)|MP NPC Sera Quest 9 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.stage to Math.min(10, _stg + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>>
	<<if _stg is 6>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>与你在后巷拦下旧货商，取回装有蓝钢游丝轮的木匣。
	<<elseif _stg is 7>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>将游丝轮嵌入星盘底座，机括弹开升起鎏金核心。
	<<elseif _stg is 9>>黎明前你们登上钟塔锁死封盖，晨钟在雾中浑厚敲响。
	<<else>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>收好旧物，替你倒了一杯热茶。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_sera_" + _npc.stage + "_keepsake")>>
		<<money 1500>><<stress -4>><span class="gold"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把 <span class="gold">£15</span> 分红塞进你掌心。</span>
	<<else>><<stress -2>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[收好旧物回去 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">收好旧物回去 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[清点所得线索 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">清点所得线索 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Sera Quest 3 Pass [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>><<set _npc.stage to 3>>
<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
<<if ($mpNpcQuestAct or 1) is 1>>
	你借煤油润透锁芯，用探针依次挑落三枚铜弹子。铁栅无声敞开，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>从竖井底拈起一枚断齿冠轮：「有人故意卡停副钟掩盖抽水声。」<span class="green">你用巧劲挑开了竖井铜锁。</span>
<<else>>
	你双手扣住通风活页的生铁栓，憋足力气硬生生将锈死的合页扳开一道容人钻入的缝隙。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>探身取出井底的断齿冠轮，赞许地拍了拍你的手背。<span class="green">你借侧壁活页打开了通路。</span>
<</if>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_sera_3")>>
	<<money 1500>><span class="gold"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>将初探所得的 <span class="gold">£15</span> 酬劳塞进你掌心。</span>
<</if>>
<<stress -5>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[回落脚处 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回落脚处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[收拢旧物证 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Quest 3 Fail [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if ($mpNpcQuestAct or 1) is 1>>
	探针在潮湿锁芯里打滑，崩断的钢丝划红了指尖。巷口传来巡夜靴声，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>连忙拉你退回暗处。<span class="red">锁舌仍死死卡着，今晚只得无功而返。</span>
<<else>>
	生铁活页栓纹丝不动，反震得你虎口发麻。铁锈簌簌落下惊动了巷口巡哨，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>连忙吹熄提灯拉你撤退。<span class="red">你震痛了手腕，只得先行退回。</span>
<</if>>
<<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gpain>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[退回安全处 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">退回安全处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[包扎擦伤 (0:05)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 5>><<pain -1>><<stress -1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Quest 6 Pass [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>><<set _npc.stage to 6>>
<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
<<if ($mpNpcQuestAct or 1) is 1>>
	你稳住分规量准圆弧夹角，算出缺失零件正是三十六齿蓝钢游丝轮。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>合上草图：「明晚我们去多瑙河街后巷把东西拦下来。」<span class="green">你算准了月相轮的制式齿距。</span>
<<else>>
	你从旧货铺底层的修表台账里翻出二十年前的进货单，精准查到了那枚三十六齿蓝钢游丝轮的编号与买主。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>惊喜地向你点头。<span class="green">你从旧台账查明了零件去向。</span>
<</if>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_sera_6")>>
	<<money 1500>><span class="gold"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>取出一封 <span class="gold">£15</span> 的中期分红信封递给你。</span>
<</if>>
<<stress -5>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[回落脚处 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回落脚处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[收拢旧物证 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

