<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[包扎擦伤 (0:05)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 5>><<pain -1>><<stress -1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Quest 9 Pass [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>><<set _npc.stage to 9>>
<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
<<if ($mpNpcQuestAct or 1) is 1>>
	你算准擒纵叉回摆的毫厘间隙，手腕一沉将鎏金核心稳稳按入主轮卡槽。钟塔齿轮发出浑厚共鸣，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>长舒一口气握紧你的手。<span class="green">你精准将发条核心嵌入主轴。</span>
<<else>>
	你双手缠住麻布猛拽配重铁索，硬生生将狂转的副轴拖慢半拍，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>趁机将鎏金核心推入卡槽。她转过身替你擦去额角热汗。<span class="green">你凭臂力稳住配重索助她合龙。</span>
<</if>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_sera_9")>>
	<<money 1500>><span class="gold"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>与你击掌庆贺，将 <span class="gold">£15</span> 钟表行会厚酬放进你掌心。</span>
<</if>>
<<stress -5>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[回落脚处 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回落脚处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[收拢旧物证 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Quest 9 Fail [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if ($mpNpcQuestAct or 1) is 1>>
	狂风从百叶窗灌入，你推入核心时慢了半秒，副轴安全栓自动锁死，指节也被铜齿刮破。<span class="red">你错过了午夜校准窗口。</span>
<<else>>
	高速滑行的配重铁索带着巨大冲力，猛地回弹擦破你的手掌，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>连忙拉你退下检修梯。<span class="red">铁索烫伤手掌，今晚只得作罢。</span>
<</if>>
<<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gpain>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[退回安全处 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">退回安全处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[包扎擦伤 (0:05)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 5>><<pain -1>><<stress -1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Street Encounter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 0 }>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>
你在高街转角偶遇拎着工具箱送修座钟的塞拉。她停下脚步，摸出一包热栗子塞进你手里。<span class="green">偶遇让你心头一暖。</span>
<<else>>
一个拎着工具箱的人在高街转角停步，箱盖弹开，几枚齿轮滚到脚边。你蹲下帮她捡起，她道谢后说自己叫<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>，在钟表铺做修缮。
<<set $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet to 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[致意后赶路 (0:02)|($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<stress -2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">致意后赶路 (0:02)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[陪她坐坐 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">陪她坐坐 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.vesper>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 0 }>><</if>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper to ($mpNpcs.vesper or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>><<set _open to (Time.hour gte 17 or Time.hour lt 7)>><<if _open>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>><</if>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Docks">><</if>>
<<if _open>>
<<endevent>><<generateNPC 1 "a" "m" "m">><<person1>>
<<if $mpNpcs.vesper.firstMeet>>栈桥边的人收起怀表，上下打量你一眼：「夜里在码头乱走，胆子不小。叫我维斯。」<<set $mpNpcs.vesper.firstMeet to 0>><<elseif (_npc.love or 0) gte 18>>防风提灯在海雾里摇晃。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>见你走来，把防水风衣披在你肩头，带着烟草味的手掌按了按你的后颈：「海风冷，跟紧我。」<<elseif (_npc.love or 0) gte 6 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 6>>集装箱阴影里亮起一点火星。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>冲你招手，递来半壶温热的生姜朗姆茶：「今晚潮水稳，过来歇会儿。」<<else>>旧港栈桥尽头弥漫着咸水与焦油味。披黑风衣的<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>倚着系船柱核对舱单，抬眼打量你：「带了暗市货包，还是来打听水路？」<</if>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>冷雨砸在集装箱铁皮上，港湾水波翻涌。<<else>>远处雾角灯塔的光束扫过黑沉沉的海面。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开栈桥 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[聊水路行情 (0:06)|MP NPC Vesper Chat]]>><<pass 6>><<stress -4>><</link>>
<br>
