:: MP NPC Vesper Chat [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper to ($mpNpcs.vesper or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcChat_vesper>><<set $daily.mpNpcChat_vesper to 1>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.vesper.firstMeet>>栈桥边的人收起怀表，上下打量你一眼：「夜里在码头乱走，胆子不小。叫我维斯。」<<set $mpNpcs.vesper.firstMeet to 0>><<elseif (_npc.love or 0) gte 18>>你与<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>并肩坐在系船石阶上。他用小刀削着浮木，低声教你分辨走私船的三短一长灯号。<<elseif (_npc.love or 0) gte 6>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>靠着货堆与你聊起近期海关巡逻艇的换防路线，顺手扔给你一枚防风铜打火机。<<else>>海风呼啸，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>言简意赅地指点你哪几座栈桥夜里少有人走。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>><<link [[回维斯身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回维斯身边 (0:02)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<loveicon>><<link [[点烟凑近领口 (0:04)|MP NPC Vesper Flirt]]>><<pass 4>><<arousal 300>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ((_npc.love or 0) gte 15 or (_npc.lust or 0) gte 12) and (!$daily or !$daily.mpNpcIntimate_vesper)>>
	<<mphearticon>><<link [[随他进底舱 (0:25)|MP NPC Vesper Intimate]]>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpNpcIntimate_vesper to 1>><<pass 25>><<arousal 1200>><<stress -10>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if (_npc.love or 0) gte 8 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 8>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[陪他夜巡 (0:08)|MP Extra Daily Vesper 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<if (_npc.love or 0) gte 12 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 12>><br><<link [[清晨去栈桥 (0:08)|MP RelDay Vesper 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Service [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper to ($mpNpcs.vesper or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>>
<<if ($mpContrabandPackages or 0) gt 0>>
	<<set _cnt to $mpContrabandPackages>><<set _pay to _cnt * 1600>><<set $mpContrabandPackages to 0>><<money _pay>>
	<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>你把封存完好的暗市货包交到<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>手里。他掂了掂分量，利落地抽出几张旧港钞票塞进你掌心。<span class="gold">货包已稳妥折算成现钱。</span>
<<else>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>挑眉看了看你空着的口袋：「黑铁货运站和沉船滩常有散落货包，找到了再来找我销账。」<span class="teal">他替你挡住了迎面的海风。</span><<stress -2>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>><<link [[回维斯身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回维斯身边 (0:02)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<div id="srv-sub-vesper">
<<investigateicon>><<link "学打水手结 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#srv-sub-vesper">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>你手指翻飞绕紧麻绳。<span class="green">双套盲结一拉即紧，维斯赞许地点头。</span><<stress -2>><<else>>湿滑麻绳在掌心散开。<span class="red">指节被粗麻磨红，你还没摸清绕法。</span><<stress 2>><</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_foghorn_whistle"]>><br><<keepsakeicon>><<link [[请他辨认铜哨 (0:06)|MP Keepsake Show Whistle]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>

