<</if>>
<<if _helpPaid>>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>你帮<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>把六只防水木箱挪进暗格，还及时打手势避开巡夜哨船。<span class="green"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>分了你 <span class="gold">£12</span> 压舱红封。</span><<stress -3>><<else>>木箱边角湿滑，你搬运时磕响了铁锚链。<span class="teal"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>按住链条替你解围，只让你把湿透的袖口拧干，没有补贴。</span><<stress 2>><</if>>
<<else>>你帮<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>把防雨帆布重新扎紧。<span class="teal">他递给你一块风干牛肉干。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>><<link [[回维斯身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回维斯身边 (0:02)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
