:: MP NPC Vesper Intimate [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper to ($mpNpcs.vesper or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>>
<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 3)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.lust to Math.max(0, (_npc.lust or 0) - 3)>>
底舱密室隔绝了海浪喧嚣。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>将你困在铺着厚羊毛毯的木箱间，滚烫的唇擦过你的耳廓，粗糙掌心稳稳护着你的后背。<span class="green">你在煤油灯暖意中彻底放松。</span><<stress -12>><<tiredness -4>><<trauma -4>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>><<link [[整理衣衫 (0:04)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">整理衣衫 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Quest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.vesper>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 0 }>><</if>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper to ($mpNpcs.vesper or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>><<set _stg to (_npc.stage or 0)>>
<<if _stg gte 5>>
	<<include "MP NPC Vesper Quest Late">>
<<elseif _stg is 2>>
	退潮后的暗礁区浪急水冷，沉船前舱的铁锚链死死压着防水铜账管。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>递来铁撬棍，让你潜入浅浪撬开锚链，或在礁盘上拉紧滑轮副缆。
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>><<link [[回维斯身边 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回维斯身边 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 250 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
		<<swimicon>><<link [[潜入浅浪撬锚链 (0:09)|MP NPC Vesper Quest 3 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 9>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<walkicon>><<link [[潜入浅浪撬锚链 (0:09)|MP NPC Vesper Quest 3 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 9>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11600 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 10>>
		<<fisticon>><<link [[绞紧滑轮副缆 (0:09)|MP NPC Vesper Quest 3 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 9>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[绞紧滑轮副缆 (0:09)|MP NPC Vesper Quest 3 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 9>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.stage to Math.min(10, _stg + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>>
	<<if _stg is 0>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>撬开冲上岸的铅封浮筒，里面是一本浸水航海日志：「旧港外沉着一艘运银砖的护卫舰，跟我干，分你一半。」
	<<elseif _stg is 1>>三号干船坞的帆布下，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>带你给快艇加装消音铜管，手把手教你辨认暗礁航标与缉私艇探照灯死角。
	<<elseif _stg is 3>>快艇返航途中遇上缉私艇巡查，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>将船滑入桥墩死角，把你拉进防风大衣下屏息躲过了探照灯。
	<<elseif _stg is 4>>船长室铁炉烧得通红，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>递给你干毛巾与姜茶，将火漆账管在炭火旁烘开，露出一张绘着暗流海沟的羊皮图。
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_vesper_" + _npc.stage)>>
		<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 250>><<money 1500>><<stress -4>><span class="gold"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>将 <span class="gold">£15</span> 补贴塞进你掌心。</span><<else>><<stress 2>><span class="gold"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>没有补贴。</span><</if>>
	<<else>><<stress -2>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>><<link [[收好东西回去 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">收好东西回去 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if _npc.stage gte 5>><<link [[翻看后续卷宗 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Quest Late]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>><<link [[核对下一步去向 (0:04)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">核对下一步去向 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Quest Late [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper to ($mpNpcs.vesper or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>><<set _stg to (_npc.stage or 5)>>
<<if _stg is 5>>
	防水铜账管内壁焊着一圈机关硫酸泡，稍有晃动就会腐蚀底单。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>屏住呼吸按住管身，让你用细铜丝挑开铅封，或用白蜡先行封堵酸液导槽。
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>><<link [[回维斯身边 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回维斯身边 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 270 or ($science or 0) gte 250>>
		<<sneakicon>><<link [[挑开内壁铅封 (0:08)|MP NPC Vesper Quest 6 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<walkicon>><<link [[挑开内壁铅封 (0:08)|MP NPC Vesper Quest 6 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 440 or ($tending or 0) gte 250 or (_npc.love or 0) gte 10>>
		<<investigateicon>><<link [[封堵酸液导槽 (0:08)|MP NPC Vesper Quest 6 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[封堵酸液导槽 (0:08)|MP NPC Vesper Quest 6 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif _stg is 8>>
	风暴夜的断桅沉船滩外，海关巡逻艇封死了主航道。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>掌稳双桅船舵轮，让你潜游去东侧暗礁点亮诱饵浮灯，或升起副帆贴着盲区强行冲关。
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>><<link [[先退回维斯身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">先退回维斯身旁 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 280 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>>
		<<link [[潜游挂诱饵灯 (0:10)|MP NPC Vesper Quest 9 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[潜游挂诱饵灯 (0:10)|MP NPC Vesper Quest 9 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 270 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11800 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 12>>
		<<link [[收帆贴礁抢航 (0:10)|MP NPC Vesper Quest 9 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[收帆贴礁抢航 (0:10)|MP NPC Vesper Quest 9 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.stage to Math.min(10, _stg + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>>
	<<if _stg is 6>>你们趁退潮划入海蚀暗洞，在石龛下起出半箱航海金器。
	<<elseif _stg is 7>>旧港栈桥边两名眼线拦路，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>与你并肩迫退对方守住货箱。
	<<elseif _stg is 9>>晨光刺破海雾，双桅船满载靠岸，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>将船长室副匙交给你。
	<<else>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>收妥账册，递给你一杯温热朗姆酒。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_vesper_" + _npc.stage + "_keepsake")>>
		<<money 1500>><<stress -4>><span class="gold"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>把 <span class="gold">£15</span> 分红塞进你掌心。</span>
	<<else>><<stress -2>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>><<link [[收好旧物回去 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">收好旧物回去 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>><<link [[清点所得线索 (0:04)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">清点所得线索 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Quest 3 Pass [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper to ($mpNpcs.vesper or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>><<set _npc.stage to 3>>
<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
<<if ($mpNpcQuestAct or 1) is 1>>
	你深吸一口气潜入冰凉海水，将撬棍插进锚链环眼发力一别，顺利抽出底下的防水铜账管。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>一把将你拉上艇舷裹进大衣。<span class="green">你潜入浪底起出了防水账管。</span>
<<else>>
	你将麻缆缠在礁石铁桩上死死绞紧，借着涌浪浮力将沉重锚链吊起半尺，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>探身抽出铜账管后冲你竖起拇指。<span class="green">你借滑轮巧劲吊起了铁锚链。</span>
<</if>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_vesper_3")>>
	<<money 1500>><span class="gold"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>将初探所得的 <span class="gold">£15</span> 酬劳塞进你掌心。</span>
<</if>>
<<stress -5>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>><<link [[回落脚处 (0:04)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回落脚处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[收拢旧物证 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

