<</if>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_vesper_9")>>
	<<money 1500>><span class="gold"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>与你击掌庆贺，将 <span class="gold">£15</span> 远航压舱红利塞进你衣袋。</span>
