:: MP NPC Vesper Street Encounter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.vesper>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 0 }>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>
你在麋鹿街巷口偶遇刚交割完货物的维斯。他塞给你一小袋烘热的咖啡豆，低声叮嘱你夜路当心。<span class="green">你在冷风里精神一振。</span>
<<else>>
防波堤边，一个拎着铜怀表的人被海风掀了帽檐。你替他按住，他说自己叫<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>，夜里在旧港跑船。
<<set $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet to 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>><<link [[致意后赶路 (0:02)|($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 2>><<stress -2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">致意后赶路 (0:02)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>><<link [[陪他坐坐 (0:04)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">陪他坐坐 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>

:: MP NPC Noel Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.noel>><<set $mpNpcs.noel to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 0 }>><</if>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.noel to ($mpNpcs.noel or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>><<set _open to (Time.hour gte 7 and Time.hour lt 20)>><<if _open>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>><</if>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "School Library")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "School Library">><</if>>
<<if _open>>
<<endevent>><<generateNPC 1 "a" "f" "f">><<person1>>
<<if $mpNpcs.noel.firstMeet>>抱着标本册的学生合上本子：「你也对这些干花感兴趣？我叫诺艾尔，在学园帮忙整理标本。」<<set $mpNpcs.noel.firstMeet to 0>><<elseif (_npc.love or 0) gte 18>>标本室飘着甘菊与干薰衣草的清香。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>一见你便放下鹅毛笔，捧起温在石棉网上的花草茶塞进你手心：「快坐下歇歇。」<<elseif (_npc.love or 0) gte 6 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 6>>阳光透过花房玻璃洒在木桌上。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>笑着替你拂去肩头灰尘：「今天新烘了柠檬马鞭草，正好给你留了一杯。」<<else>>学校标本室里排满浸液瓶与植物压片。温和的<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>正给草药贴标签，抬头微微笑道：「来查植物图谱，还是想讨杯安神茶？」<</if>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨点轻敲玻璃花房顶棚，室内药草香愈发温润。<<else>>暖阳照亮叶脉标本，空气里浮着淡淡蜂蜜味。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开标本室 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<if _exitPas is "Park">><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<else>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><</if>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[聊草木图谱 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Chat]]>><<pass 6>><<stress -4>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[请她配草药茶 (0:08)|MP NPC Noel Service]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[压制干花贴签 (0:16)|MP NPC Noel Help]]>><<pass 16>><<tiredness 2>><<stress -3>><</link>>
<br>
<<if (_npc.stage or 0) lt 10 and (!$daily or !$daily.mpNpcQuest_noel)>>
	<<link [[打听夜光兰 (0:20)|MP NPC Noel Quest]]>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpNpcQuest_noel to 1>><<pass 20>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<else>>
<span class="disabled">标本室的门已经上锁，走廊里只剩清扫的脚步声。诺艾尔随下课的学生离开了，学园开放时段（7:00–20:00）才在。</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

