<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.noel to ($mpNpcs.noel or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcChat_noel>><<set $daily.mpNpcChat_noel to 1>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.noel.firstMeet>>抱着标本册的学生合上本子：「你也对这些干花感兴趣？我叫诺艾尔，在学园帮忙整理标本。」<<set $mpNpcs.noel.firstMeet to 0>><<elseif (_npc.love or 0) gte 18>>你挨着<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>翻看手绘本草图鉴。她声音轻柔，时不时把晒干的甜橙片喂到你嘴边。<<elseif (_npc.love or 0) gte 6>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>一边给标本换吸水纸，一边教你辨认森林里哪几种浆果能解乏止痛。<<else>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>安静地听你说话，偶尔递上写满拉丁学名的书签供你参考。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet>><<link [[回诺艾尔身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回诺艾尔身边 (0:02)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[擦去鼻尖花粉 (0:04)|MP NPC Noel Flirt]]>><<pass 4>><<arousal 300>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ((_npc.love or 0) gte 15 or (_npc.lust or 0) gte 12) and (!$daily or !$daily.mpNpcIntimate_noel)>>
	<<mphearticon>><<link [[随她进暖阁 (0:25)|MP NPC Noel Intimate]]>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpNpcIntimate_noel to 1>><<pass 25>><<arousal 1200>><<stress -10>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if (_npc.love or 0) gte 8 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 8>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[修剪药草垄 (0:08)|MP Extra Daily Noel 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<if (_npc.love or 0) gte 12 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 12>><br><<link [[清晨去药草垄 (0:08)|MP RelDay Noel 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP NPC Noel Service [nobr]
