<<if !$daily.mpNpcHelp_lin>>
	<<set $daily.mpNpcHelp_lin to 1>><<set _helpPaid to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>><<money 1200>><</if>>
<</if>>
<<if _helpPaid>>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>你与<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>巡过三处暗巷，惊走两名撬锁混混并拾获巡防赏格。<span class="green"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>将 <span class="gold">£12</span> 联防津贴分给了你。</span><<stress -3>><<else>>你在青石台阶上踩滑崴了脚，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>背着你走回岗棚。<span class="teal">他替你揉开脚踝，只替你收拾好工具，没有补贴。</span><<stress 2>><</if>>
<<else>>你陪<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>检查了孤儿院后门的铜锁。<span class="teal">夜路安静，他塞给你一颗薄荷糖。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>><<link [[回林恩身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回林恩身边 (0:02)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[提灯排查暗哨 (0:06)|MP NPC Lin Hub]]>><<pass 6>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<else>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Lin Flirt [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to ($mpNpcs.lin or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.lin>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>>
