<<if !$daily.mpNpcFlirt_monet>><<set $daily.mpNpcFlirt_monet to 1>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.lust to Math.min(100, (_npc.lust or 0) + 2)>><</if>>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 240 or (_npc.love or 0) gte 10>>你走到<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>身后，替她将沾了颜料的长发挽起。她仰头靠在你怀里，涂着丹蔻的指尖轻抚你的唇角：「这抹颜色，比画布上的更好看。」<span class="green">香气与暖意在鼻尖萦绕。</span><<stress -3>><<else>>你夸赞她调出的晚霞色泽绝妙。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>眼波流转，用画笔尾端轻轻点了点你的手背。<span class="teal">笑意在她唇边荡开。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>><<link [[回莫奈身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回莫奈身边 (0:02)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>><<socialiseicon>><<link [[低声交谈 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Chat]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">低声交谈 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>

:: MP NPC Monet Intimate [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.monet to ($mpNpcs.monet or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>>
<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 3)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.lust to Math.max(0, (_npc.lust or 0) - 3)>>
丝绒屏风后烛火摇曳。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>解开繁复的披肩，与你在微凉的丝绸床单间相拥。她微凉的指尖顺着你的脊线缓缓滑落，低语如梦。<span class="green">你在极致温柔中忘却了烦忧。</span><<stress -12>><<tiredness -4>><<trauma -4>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>><<link [[整理衣衫 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">整理衣衫 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>

:: MP NPC Monet Quest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.monet>><<set $mpNpcs.monet to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 0 }>><</if>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.monet to ($mpNpcs.monet or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>><<set _stg to (_npc.stage or 0)>>
<<if _stg gte 5>>
	<<include "MP NPC Monet Quest Late">>
<<elseif _stg is 2>>
	海风咖啡馆二楼包厢里，假画商把交割印鉴锁在红木匣中。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>在前厅拖住随从，让你用软蜡拓下印模，或隔着屏风临摹印文笔法。
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>><<link [[回莫奈身边 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回莫奈身边 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
		<<sneakicon>><<link [[软蜡拓印模 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Quest 3 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<walkicon>><<link [[软蜡拓印模 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Quest 3 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($english or 0) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 250 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 10>>
		<<investigateicon>><<link [[临摹印鉴花押 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Quest 3 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[临摹印鉴花押 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Quest 3 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.stage to Math.min(10, _stg + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>>
	<<if _stg is 0>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>展开一幅被裁去落款的素描：「拍卖行有人冒用我的名义卖赝品，帮我把背后的画商揪出来。」
	<<elseif _stg is 1>>在镜面试衣沙龙，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>替你换上贴身丝绒礼服，借量体裁衣的机会将一枚微缩铜印藏进你的袖扣。
	<<elseif _stg is 3>>假面酒会上，你借与贵宾碰杯的掩护，将<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>特制的荧光显影粉抹在了赝品画框的右下角。
	<<elseif _stg is 4>>回到天鹅绒画室，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>让你披上轻纱斜倚在软榻上，在烛光下一笔笔勾勒出用做掉包诱饵的《午夜缪斯》。
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_monet_" + _npc.stage)>>
		<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 250>><<money 1500>><<stress -4>><span class="gold"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>将 <span class="gold">£15</span> 补贴塞进你掌心。</span><<else>><<stress 2>><span class="gold"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>没有补贴。</span><</if>>
	<<else>><<stress -2>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>><<link [[收好东西回去 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">收好东西回去 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if _npc.stage gte 5>><<link [[翻看后续卷宗 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Quest Late]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>><<link [[核对下一步去向 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">核对下一步去向 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Monet Quest Late [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.monet to ($mpNpcs.monet or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>><<set _stg to (_npc.stage or 5)>>
<<if _stg is 5>>
	用于调包的诱饵画卷必须在天亮前做旧烘干，否则金粉会在展厅射灯下露馅。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>调好松烟水，让你用羽扇控温烘烤，或用茶水均匀刷染画背。
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>><<link [[回莫奈身边 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回莫奈身边 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 250>>
		<<tendingicon>><<link [[控温烘绢 (0:09)|MP NPC Monet Quest 6 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 9>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<walkicon>><<link [[控温烘绢 (0:09)|MP NPC Monet Quest 6 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 9>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 440 or (_npc.love or 0) gte 10>>
		<<investigateicon>><<link [[刷染画背 (0:09)|MP NPC Monet Quest 6 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 9>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[刷染画背 (0:09)|MP NPC Monet Quest 6 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 9>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif _stg is 8>>
	天鹅绒拍卖厅后台，真迹画框四角挂着敏感的警报铜铃。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>在展厅举牌吸引视线，让你用丝绵塞住铜铃摘下画芯，或旋松画架背板从后方抽画。
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>><<link [[先退回莫奈身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">先退回莫奈身旁 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 270>>
		<<link [[取下真迹 (0:10)|MP NPC Monet Quest 9 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[取下真迹 (0:10)|MP NPC Monet Quest 9 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 460 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 12>>
		<<link [[旋开背板抽画 (0:10)|MP NPC Monet Quest 9 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[旋开背板抽画 (0:10)|MP NPC Monet Quest 9 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.stage to Math.min(10, _stg + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>>
	<<if _stg is 6>>拍场揭幕时，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>用紫光灯照出赝品暗记，假画商当场败露。
	<<elseif _stg is 7>>散场后你们从后台暗格取回银线织锦真迹，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>眼眶微红。
	<<elseif _stg is 9>>画展之夜，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>将画室纯银副匙系在你颈间，在帷幔后吻住你。
	<<else>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>收起画笔，替你理好微乱的衣领。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_monet_" + _npc.stage + "_keepsake")>>
		<<money 1500>><<stress -4>><span class="gold"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>把 <span class="gold">£15</span> 分红塞进你掌心。</span>
	<<else>><<stress -2>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>><<link [[收好旧物回去 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">收好旧物回去 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>><<link [[清点所得线索 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">清点所得线索 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Monet Quest 3 Pass [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.monet to ($mpNpcs.monet or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>><<set _npc.stage to 3>>
<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
<<if ($mpNpcQuestAct or 1) is 1>>
	你用银簪拨开红木匣暗扣，将温软蜂蜡按在玛瑙印章上，完整拓下了带缺口的双天鹅印模。<span class="green">你用蜂蜡清晰拓下了交割印模。</span>
<<else>>
	你借着落地窗透进的斜阳，用极细炭笔将桌角火漆信封上的双天鹅暗纹分毫不差地摹在描图纸上。<span class="green">你精准临摹出了印鉴防伪花押。</span>
<</if>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_monet_3")>>
	<<money 1500>><span class="gold"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>将初探所得的 <span class="gold">£15</span> 酬劳塞进你掌心。</span>
<</if>>
<<stress -5>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>><<link [[回落脚处 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回落脚处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[收拢旧物证 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Quest 3 Fail [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.monet to ($mpNpcs.monet or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
<<if ($mpNpcQuestAct or 1) is 1>>
	红木匣内侧连着一根防盗铜铃丝，你刚撬开半寸便响起清脆铃声，只得连忙合上匣盖退回楼梯口。<span class="red">暗铃作响，你只得空手退回前厅。</span>
<<else>>
	包厢光线昏暗，你临摹时炭笔芯折断，楼梯口已传来画商上楼的谈话声，只得收起纸笔匆匆撤离。<span class="red">笔芯折断且脚步逼近，未能摹完。</span>
<</if>>
<<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gpain>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>><<link [[退回安全处 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">退回安全处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[包扎擦伤 (0:05)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 5>><<pain -1>><<stress -1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Quest 6 Pass [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.monet to ($mpNpcs.monet or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>><<set _npc.stage to 6>>
<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
<<if ($mpNpcQuestAct or 1) is 1>>
	你手腕轻摇羽扇，让银炭热流均匀拂过绢面，松烟与金粉自然沁入肌理，呈现出毫无破绽的百年古意。<span class="green">你控温烘出了天衣无缝的旧绢光泽。</span>
<<else>>
	你执起宽排羊毛刷沾取浓茶，力道均匀地刷过整幅画背，干透后的包浆与真迹一般无二，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>欣喜地抱住你。<span class="green">你用茶染技法完美复刻了古画包浆。</span>
<</if>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_monet_6")>>
	<<money 1500>><span class="gold"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>取出一封 <span class="gold">£15</span> 的中期分红信封递给你。</span>
<</if>>
<<stress -5>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>><<link [[回落脚处 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回落脚处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
