:: MP NPC Monet Street Encounter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.monet>><<set $mpNpcs.monet to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 0 }>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>
你在海风咖啡馆露台偶遇正在速写的莫奈。她撕下一页画着你侧影的速写纸折好塞进你口袋。<span class="green">这份小礼物让你嘴角上扬。</span>
<<else>>
海风走廊的露台上，一个拿素描本的人正在画街景。你驻足看了两眼，她把画翻给你看，说自己叫<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>。
<<set $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet to 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>><<link [[致意后赶路 (0:02)|($mpReturnPassage or "Connudatus Street")]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<stress -2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">致意后赶路 (0:02)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>><<link [[陪她坐坐 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 8>><<stress -4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">陪她坐坐 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>

:: MP NPC Ash Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.ash>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 0 }>><</if>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to ($mpNpcs.ash or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Forest")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Forest">><</if>>
<<endevent>><<generateNPC 1 "a" "m" "m">><<person1>>
<<if $mpNpcs.ash.firstMeet>>提灯的人解开猎犬腿上的荆棘，抬头看你：「一个人走这条石径？我叫阿什，顺路的话可以跟一段。」<<set $mpNpcs.ash.firstMeet to 0>><<elseif (_npc.love or 0) gte 18>>篝火噼啪作响。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>一听见你踩碎落叶的脚步，便起身将烘暖的鹿皮斗篷裹在你身上，粗糙指腹擦过你的脸颊：「林子雾重，过来坐。」<<elseif (_npc.love or 0) gte 6 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 6>>古石径旁的木桩上放着一罐热姜汤。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>收起猎弓朝你招手：「刚巡完北坡，给你留了热的。」<<else>>深林雾气在冷杉间流转。披着灰绿斗篷的<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>正蹲在溪边磨骨刀，抬头静静看向你：「迷路了，还是想找向导？」<</if>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>林雨打在冷杉枝叶上，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>搭起的油布棚下干爽温暖。<<else>>松脂清香混着泥土气息，林冠间漏下斑驳天光。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开林间 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[聊山林旧事 (0:06)|MP NPC Ash Chat]]>><<pass 6>><<stress -4>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[认林间兽径 (0:08)|MP NPC Ash Service]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[劈柴晾草药 (0:16)|MP NPC Ash Help]]>><<pass 16>><<tiredness 2>><<stress -3>><</link>>
<br>
<<if (_npc.stage or 0) lt 10 and (!$daily or !$daily.mpNpcQuest_ash)>>
	<<link [[探寻断碑铭文 (0:20)|MP NPC Ash Quest]]>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpNpcQuest_ash to 1>><<pass 20>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Ash Chat [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to ($mpNpcs.ash or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcChat_ash>><<set $daily.mpNpcChat_ash to 1>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.ash.firstMeet>>提灯的人解开猎犬腿上的荆棘，抬头看你：「一个人走这条石径？我叫阿什，顺路的话可以跟一段。」<<set $mpNpcs.ash.firstMeet to 0>><<elseif (_npc.love or 0) gte 18>>你依偎在<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>身旁看火苗跳跃。他用骨刀雕出一只小木鹿塞进你掌心，低沉嗓音里满是温和。<<elseif (_npc.love or 0) gte 6>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>指着树皮上的青苔厚薄，教你如何在大雾天分辨南北与沼泽边界。<<else>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>话不多，但每当你提起林中异动，他都会认真记下并提醒你避开险处。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[回阿什身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回阿什身边 (0:02)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<loveicon>><<link [[依偎他肩头 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Flirt]]>><<pass 4>><<arousal 300>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ((_npc.love or 0) gte 15 or (_npc.lust or 0) gte 12) and (!$daily or !$daily.mpNpcIntimate_ash)>>
	<<mphearticon>><<link [[随他进树屋 (0:25)|MP NPC Ash Intimate]]>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpNpcIntimate_ash to 1>><<pass 25>><<arousal 1200>><<stress -10>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if (_npc.love or 0) gte 8 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 8>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去下游收鱼篓 (0:08)|MP Extra Daily Ash 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<if (_npc.love or 0) gte 12 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 12>><br><<link [[清晨劈松柴 (0:08)|MP RelDay Ash 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>

