:: MP NPC Ash Intimate [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to ($mpNpcs.ash or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>>
<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 3)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.lust to Math.max(0, (_npc.lust or 0) - 3)>>
高耸古橡树冠上的木屋温暖静谧。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>将你裹在厚实的狼皮毯里，低头吻去你眉睫上的雾水，结实的手臂整夜未曾松开。<span class="green">山林夜风再也吹不进你心里。</span><<stress -12>><<tiredness -4>><<trauma -4>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[整理衣衫 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">整理衣衫 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>

:: MP NPC Ash Quest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.ash>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 0 }>><</if>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to ($mpNpcs.ash or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>><<set _stg to (_npc.stage or 0)>>
<<if _stg gte 5>>
	<<include "MP NPC Ash Quest Late">>
<<elseif _stg is 2>>
	第二枚青铜圣徽沉在深林暗河的旋涡潭底，水草缠着断裂的古碑角。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>在岸边攥紧麻绳，让你潜入潭底摸取圣徽，或用带钩长竹竿从石缝勾出。
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[回阿什身边 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回阿什身边 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 260 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
		<<swimicon>><<link [[潜入潭底摸取 (0:09)|MP NPC Ash Quest 3 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 9>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<walkicon>><<link [[潜入潭底摸取 (0:09)|MP NPC Ash Quest 3 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 9>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 440 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 10>>
		<<tendingicon>><<link [[长竿拨水草勾取 (0:09)|MP NPC Ash Quest 3 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 9>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[长竿拨水草勾取 (0:09)|MP NPC Ash Quest 3 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 9>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.stage to Math.min(10, _stg + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>>
	<<if _stg is 0>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>在守林人石屋摊开半张兽皮拓片：「深林古祭坛的封印松了，盗墓贼在找地底藏骨堂，帮我守住石环。」
	<<elseif _stg is 1>>夜雨初歇，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>提着防风灯带你走过神殿后园古道，在倒塌石碑下拓下了第一枚德鲁伊方位符文。
	<<elseif _stg is 3>>山涧暴涨冲垮了独木桥，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>果断涉水揽住你的腰，把你带进干燥岩洞生起松木火堆烘烤湿衣。
	<<elseif _stg is 4>>深林雾气弥漫，三名持镐盗墓贼正在撬动月泉石砖，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>指挥猎犬与你从两侧包抄，将盗墓贼驱出林地。
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_ash_" + _npc.stage)>>
		<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 250>><<money 1500>><<stress -4>><span class="gold"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>将 <span class="gold">£15</span> 补贴塞进你掌心。</span><<else>><<stress 2>><span class="gold"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>没有补贴。</span><</if>>
	<<else>><<stress -2>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[收好东西回去 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">收好东西回去 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if _npc.stage gte 5>><<link [[翻看后续卷宗 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Quest Late]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[核对下一步去向 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">核对下一步去向 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Ash Quest Late [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to ($mpNpcs.ash or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>><<set _stg to (_npc.stage or 5)>>
<<if _stg is 5>>
	古根地穴深处积聚着陈年腐叶瘴气，必须按四象方位依次拨通石壁上的排风孔。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>举着风向草，让你顺着微风掏空石孔，或爬上树根穹顶推开天窗。
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[回阿什身边 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回阿什身边 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 250>>
		<<investigateicon>><<link [[掏通排风孔 (0:09)|MP NPC Ash Quest 6 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 9>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<walkicon>><<link [[掏通排风孔 (0:09)|MP NPC Ash Quest 6 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 9>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11600 or (_npc.love or 0) gte 10>>
		<<runicon>><<link [[顶开换气石板 (0:09)|MP NPC Ash Quest 6 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 9>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[顶开换气石板 (0:09)|MP NPC Ash Quest 6 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 9>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif _stg is 8>>
	血月升起前，一群受惊的林间野猪冲向古祭坛石环。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>拉满猎弓守住正面，让你挥动松明火把封住西侧缺口，或吹响守林人骨哨引开头猪。
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[先退回阿什身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">先退回阿什身旁 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11800 or ($willpower or 0) gte 460>>
		<<link [[封堵西侧缺口 (0:10)|MP NPC Ash Quest 9 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[封堵西侧缺口 (0:10)|MP NPC Ash Quest 9 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 1>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 270 or ($athletics or 0) gte 270 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 12>>
		<<link [[吹响驱兽骨哨 (0:10)|MP NPC Ash Quest 9 Pass]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[吹响驱兽骨哨 (0:10)|MP NPC Ash Quest 9 Fail]]>><<set $mpNpcQuestAct to 2>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.stage to Math.min(10, _stg + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>>
	<<if _stg is 6>>集齐三枚圣徽后，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>带你开启古根藏骨堂，封存好先人遗物。
	<<elseif _stg is 7>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>把盗墓贼遗落的金银器折算分给你，猎犬亲昵地蹭着你。
	<<elseif _stg is 9>>篝火噼啪作响，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>将打磨好的狼牙平安符系在你手腕上。
	<<else>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>添上松柴，递给你一碗驱寒热汤。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_ash_" + _npc.stage + "_keepsake")>>
		<<money 1500>><<stress -4>><span class="gold"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>把 <span class="gold">£15</span> 分红塞进你掌心。</span>
	<<else>><<stress -2>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[收好旧物回去 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">收好旧物回去 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[清点所得线索 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">清点所得线索 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Ash Quest 3 Pass [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to ($mpNpcs.ash or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>><<set _npc.stage to 3>>
<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
<<if ($mpNpcQuestAct or 1) is 1>>
	你深吸一口气潜入冰澈潭底，拨开缠绕的水草从碑座凹槽抠出青铜圣徽，拉动麻绳由<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>一把拉上河岸。<span class="green">你潜入寒潭顺利取出了青铜圣徽。</span>
<<else>>
	你趴在岸边岩石上，借着防风灯光用长竿铁钩精准勾住圣徽挂环，稳稳将其挑出水面收入掌心。<span class="green">你用长竿巧劲勾出了潭底圣徽。</span>
<</if>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_ash_3")>>
	<<money 1500>><span class="gold"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>将初探所得的 <span class="gold">£15</span> 酬劳塞进你掌心。</span>
<</if>>
<<stress -5>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[回落脚处 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回落脚处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[收拢旧物证 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Quest 3 Fail [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to ($mpNpcs.ash or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<if ($mpNpcQuestAct or 1) is 1>>
	潭底旋涡吸力惊人，冰冷水草缠住你的脚踝，你呛了一口冷水，幸亏<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>及时收绳将你拽回岸上。<span class="red">寒潭旋涡过急，你呛水受寒未能取到。</span>
<<else>>
	长竿在湍急水流中剧烈晃动，铁钩碰歪了圣徽使其滑入更深的石缝，手掌也被竹刺刮破。<span class="red">水流冲偏长竿，只能等退水再试。</span>
<</if>>
<<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gpain>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[退回安全处 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">退回安全处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[包扎擦伤 (0:05)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 5>><<pain -1>><<stress -1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Quest 6 Pass [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to ($mpNpcs.ash or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>><<set _npc.stage to 6>>
<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
<<if ($mpNpcQuestAct or 1) is 1>>
	你顺着风向草的摆幅，用短刀依次清开东南西北四处石孔的泥封，林间新风瞬间涌入驱散了浑浊瘴气。<span class="green">你按古法疏通了地穴排风孔道。</span>
<<else>>
	你踩着盘结的粗壮树根爬上穹顶，用肩膀顶开覆满落叶的换气石板，清冷山风倾泻而下扫清了地穴。<span class="green">你顶开穹顶石板引来了林间清风。</span>
<</if>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_ash_6")>>
	<<money 1500>><span class="gold"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>取出一封 <span class="gold">£15</span> 的中期分红信封递给你。</span>
<</if>>
<<stress -5>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[回落脚处 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回落脚处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[收拢旧物证 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Quest 6 Fail [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to ($mpNpcs.ash or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<if ($mpNpcQuestAct or 1) is 1>>
	地穴内雾气迷眼，你挖错了第三处盲孔，一股酸腐冷气迎面扑来呛得你头晕目眩，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>连忙背你退回洞口。<span class="red">瘴气扑面令人眩晕，只得退出换气。</span>
<<else>>
	穹顶树根凝满滑腻水珠，你攀爬到半途脚下一滑摔在厚苔藓上，手肘磕出一片青紫。<span class="red">湿滑树根令你失足，未能顶开石板。</span>
<</if>>
<<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gpain>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[退回安全处 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">退回安全处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[包扎擦伤 (0:05)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 5>><<pain -1>><<stress -1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Quest 9 Pass [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to ($mpNpcs.ash or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>><<set _npc.stage to 9>>
<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
<<if ($mpNpcQuestAct or 1) is 1>>
	你双手挥动燃烧的松脂火把在石柱间划出火墙，暴躁的领头野猪畏惧烈焰调头逃入密林，祭坛完好无损。<span class="green">你用松明火墙震退了冲撞的兽群。</span>
<<else>>
	你翻身跃上风化石柱，吹出悠长尖锐的头狼威慑哨音，受惊的野猪群顿时阵脚大乱，纷纷折向山谷奔逃。<span class="green">你用驱兽骨哨完美引开了野猪群。</span>
<</if>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_ash_9")>>
	<<money 1500>><span class="gold"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>与你击掌庆贺，将 <span class="gold">£15</span> 秘境考据重酬放入你怀中。</span>
<</if>>
<<stress -5>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[回落脚处 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回落脚处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[收拢旧物证 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Quest 9 Fail [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to ($mpNpcs.ash or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<if ($mpNpcQuestAct or 1) is 1>>
	夜雨打湿了松脂，火苗忽明忽暗，一头野猪擦着石柱冲过，飞溅的碎石刮破你的小腿，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>急忙放箭将你护上高台。<span class="red">火把受潮暗淡，你被碎石擦伤小腿。</span>
<<else>>
	你在冷风中气息不稳，骨哨吹出了破音，野猪群撞翻了外围石灯笼，你们只得先退上瞭望台暂避。<span class="red">哨音走调未能驱兽，石坛外围受损。</span>
<</if>>
<<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gpain>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[退回安全处 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">退回安全处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[包扎擦伤 (0:05)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 5>><<pain -1>><<stress -1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Street Encounter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.ash>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 0 }>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>
你在神殿后山石径偶遇下山送药材的阿什。他塞给你一小瓶封好的野蜂巢蜜。<span class="green">清甜蜂蜜让你倦意顿消。</span>
<<else>>
山石小径上，一个提防风灯的人正替猎犬挑脚掌的刺。你按住狗头，他说自己叫<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>，常在林子里守夜。
<<set $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet to 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[致意后赶路 (0:02)|($mpReturnPassage or "Forest")]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 2>><<stress -2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">致意后赶路 (0:02)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[陪他坐坐 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">陪他坐坐 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
